---
type Locale = 'zh' | 'en';
const { locale } = Astro.props as { locale: Locale };
const isZh = locale === 'zh';
const basePath = isZh ? '/zh' : '/en';
---

<section class="intro-card" aria-labelledby="home-title">
  <p class="intro-card__eyebrow">AI Daily / 01</p>
  <h1 id="home-title" class="intro-card__title">{isZh ? '记录智能时代，也记录自己的思考。' : 'Notes for the intelligent age, and for the mind behind it.'}</h1>
  <p class="intro-card__description">{isZh ? '这里会分享人工智能、产品设计、效率工具，以及那些值得慢下来观察的变化。' : 'Writing about artificial intelligence, product craft, productivity tools, and changes worth observing slowly.'}</p>
</section>

<section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="latest-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div><p class="section-eyebrow">Writing</p><h2 id="latest-title" class="section-heading__title">{isZh ? '最近更新' : 'Latest notes'}</h2></div>
    <a class="section-heading__link" href={basePath + '/archives/'}>{isZh ? '查看归档 →' : 'View archives →'}</a>
  </div>
  <article class="post-preview">
    <div class="post-preview__meta"><span>2026 / 08 / 31</span><span>{isZh ? '阅读 · 5 min' : '5 min read'}</span></div>
    <h3 class="post-preview__title"><a href={basePath + '/posts/designing-a-calm-ai-workflow/'}>{isZh ? '为 AI 工作流保留一点安静的空间' : 'Making room for calm in an AI workflow'}</a></h3>
    <p class="post-preview__excerpt">{isZh ? '先从整理输入、减少切换和建立可复用的上下文开始，让工具真正服务于思考。' : 'Start by organizing inputs, reducing context switching, and building reusable context so tools can serve the thinking.'}</p>
    <div class="post-preview__tags"><span class="post-tag">AI</span><span class="post-tag">{isZh ? '效率' : 'Productivity'}</span></div>
  </article>
  <article class="post-preview">
    <div class="post-preview__meta"><span>2026 / 08 / 28</span><span>{isZh ? '阅读 · 4 min' : '4 min read'}</span></div>
    <h3 class="post-preview__title"><a href={basePath + '/posts/notes-on-digital-garden/'}>{isZh ? '数字花园不只是一个网站' : 'A digital garden is more than a website'}</a></h3>
    <p class="post-preview__excerpt">{isZh ? '它更像一套让想法持续生长的工作方式：允许草稿存在，也允许观点不断修正。' : 'It is a way of letting ideas grow: drafts are welcome, and opinions are allowed to change over time.'}</p>
    <div class="post-preview__tags"><span class="post-tag">{isZh ? '写作' : 'Writing'}</span><span class="post-tag">{isZh ? '知识管理' : 'Knowledge'}</span></div>
  </article>
</section>
